887	     * is derived from the owner's household identity — its {@code lastName} and {@code postcode} (see
888	     * {@link #householdIdFor(String, String)}) — so every owner sharing a last name and postcode
889	     * resolves to the same stable value automatically, without any explicit linking. An owner without
890	     * a postcode belongs to no shared household and is left without a household identifier.
891	     *
892	     * @param owner the newly created owner, mutated in place with its household identifier
893	     */
894	    private void assignHousehold(Owner owner) {
