912	     * Derives the stable {@code householdId} shared by every owner in the household identified by
913	     * the given {@code lastName} and {@code postcode}. The household is keyed on {@code (lastName,
914	     * postcode)}: the normalized last name and the postcode are hashed with SHA-256 and the leading
915	     * 12 hex characters of the digest form the identifier, so any two owners sharing a last name and
916	     * postcode — regardless of creation order or address — resolve to the same identifier
917	     * automatically. An owner without a postcode belongs to no shared household, so {@code null} is
918	     * returned.
