933	     * {@code postcode} belong to: the normalized last name (case-insensitive, with collapsed
934	     * whitespace) joined to the postcode by {@code '|'}. This is the single definition of which
935	     * owner fields make up a household and how they are normalized;
936	     * {@link #householdIdFor(String, String)} hashes this key into the stored identifier, so any two
937	     * owners in the same household resolve to the same key and therefore the same identifier.
