950	     * identifier). The digest itself comes from {@link Owner#sha256Hex(String)}, the single
951	     * definition of the SHA-256 hex derivation; this method only takes its leading characters and
952	     * upper-cases them, so {@code hexChars} characters cover the leading {@code ceil(hexChars / 2)}
