1001	     * (see {@link #countHouseholdMembers(String)}), so every value the owner derives from its
1002	     * household size (its membership factor and level) reads a populated count rather than the
1003	     * unstamped default. This is the single definition of hydrating an owner with its household
1004	     * member count, shared by the create and read paths that render an owner's derived values.
1005	     *
1006	     * @param owner the owner to stamp, mutated in place with its household member count
1007	     */
1008	    private void applyHouseholdMemberCount(Owner owner) {
1009	        owner.setHouseholdMemberCount(countHouseholdMembers(owner.getHouseholdId()));
1010	    }
