1014	     * current maximum {@code membershipLevel} among the existing, non-deleted owners already
1015	     * sharing its household (see {@link #householdMembers(String)}). Each existing member is
1016	     * stamped with its household member count first so its {@link Owner#getMembershipLevel()}
