1037	     * every internal run of whitespace is reduced to a single space. A {@code null} value collapses
1038	     * to the empty string. Case is left untouched so callers can compare case-insensitively.
1039	     *
1040	     * @param value the value to collapse, or {@code null}
1041	     * @return the whitespace-collapsed value, never {@code null}
1042	     */
