81	     * {@code REGION} segment carried by the owner's {@code customerCode}, whose new
82	     * {@code '<REGION>-<HASH8>'} identity encodes the region ahead of the first {@code '-'}. The
83	     * sentinel {@code 'UNKNOWN'} region (used when the owner has no known region) and a missing
